        "created_at": "2022-07-26T03:45:51.767Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I’ve never played Tactics, but I hear that it had some lore bits for included characters, giving insight into the Seasons and so on. Now, given that the expansions were cancelled, this might be quite a long shot, but I was wondering if we had any lore bits from Broken City or For Profit? I’d love to get anything more about Exemplar, or the Spites, and so on.</p>",
